  "title": "Unified AI Models for Audio-Video Generation and Editing",
  "summary": "Multi2AV-Safety introduces a safety benchmark for multimodal-to-audio-video generation, while OmniVAE enhances audio-video joint generation through cross-modal alignment. All methods demonstrate improved performance and robustness across benchmarks. Vorch-Streamer, Vorch-Director, and Vorch-Omni represent advancements in real-time long-form audio-visual generation, addressing challenges in continuous synthesis, causal continuity, and multi-modal orchestration.",
